---
title: "Care-task reminders: resync, snooze, complete, delete"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: settling
    lg1: settled
    lg2: Breaks OffMeansSilent
    lg3: Path to the OffMeansSilent bug
  }
  class lg0 orange
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Settled, permission not read yet, no snooze
  s1: resync running, permission not read yet, no snooze
  s2: resync running, reminders off, no snooze
  s3: Settled, reminders off, no snooze
  s4: snooze tapped, reminders off, no snooze
  s5: snooze on its way, reminders off, no snooze
  s6: Settled, reminders off, 1 snooze
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you switch reminders in Settings
  s1 --> s1: the resync reads the saved tasks
  s1 --> s2: the resync reads the permission
  s2 --> s2: the resync reads the pending reminders or the resync removes stale reminders
  s2 --> s3: the resync finishes
  s3 --> s3: the app launches and reads the permission
  s3 --> s4: you tap Remind me on a reminder
  s4 --> s5: the snooze looks up the task
  s5 --> s6: the snooze is scheduled
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 orange
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 orange
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 orange
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 orange
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 blue
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
